classDiagram
    class Task {
        +description: str
        +duration_minutes: int
        +frequency: str
        +is_completed: bool
        +priority: str
        +scheduled_time: str
        +due_date: date
        +mark_complete() None
        +next_occurrence(completed_on: date) Task
        +describe() str
    }

    class Pet {
        +name: str
        +species: str
        +tasks: list~Task~
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(task: Task) None
    }

    class Owner {
        +name: str
        +pets: list~Pet~
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +remove_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +owner: Owner
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name: str, is_completed: bool) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts(tasks: list~Task~) list~str~
        +organize_tasks() list~Task~
        +create_schedule(available_minutes: int) list~Task~
        +mark_complete(task: Task, completed_on: date) None
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : cares for
    Pet "1" o-- "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : retrieves all pets' tasks from
